   ],
   "html": "<p>Universal Studios and Peacock engaged IHC to produce an influencer event for the release of their feature film <em>Firestarter</em>.</p>\n<p>Taking place at a popular Hollywood venue, this fun happy hour activation brought the film to life in an environment where guests were entertained with plenty to share. Full of photo opps, themed F&amp;B (including flaming cocktails) and immersive world building, it was truly a night to remember.</p>\n<p>The film’s lead Ryan Kiera Armstrong paid a visit, posing with guests in front of the iconic flaming logo. DJ Bianca Lexus kept the dance floor alive while Cobrasnake captured the night.</p>"
  }
 ],
 "sections": [
  {
   "title": "SETTING THE SCENE",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text",
     "html": "<p>Upon arrival, guests were immediately welcomed onto the scene of Charlie’s accident, through artful set dressing and in-world details, and the <em>Firestarter</em> film at large with massive fire projections and a burning logo. Immersive DSI Agents in their combat gear and fire-protective suits interacted with guests while on the hunt for Charlie. They hunted clues throughout the night and interrogated guests while Charlie did her best to stay hidden.</p>"
    },
