  {
   "title": "Photo moments",
   "pieces": [
    {
     "type": "text2",
     "left": "<p>Guests were able to pay homage to the <em>Firestarter</em> poster with our statement LED photo booth that placed them in the flames. Guests lined up all night long to participate and place themselves inside the iconic image. Tommy B was the master behind the lens, providing printed takeaways and an instantly shareable digital copy.</p>",
     "right": "<p>Attendees also had the opportunity to recreate the iconic “<em>Disaster Girl</em>” meme, which features a no-fucks-given little girl watching a house burn. Guests went wild creating memorable memes of their own. Tommy B was the master behind the lens, providing printed takeaways and an instantly shareable digital copy.</p>"
